            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Phase 1 \u2014 Brute force</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Setup:</strong> Every trial is accepted automatically; only <strong><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(d||)</marimo-tex></strong> and <strong><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(p||)</marimo-tex></strong> matter.</li>\n<li><strong>Your task:</strong> Raise <strong><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(d||)</marimo-tex></strong> until logical errors feel rare.</li>\n<li><strong>Payoff:</strong> Baseline <strong>overhead <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\propto d^3||)</marimo-tex></strong> per accepted gate\u2014notice how expensive \u201cdistance only\u201d becomes.</li>\n<li><strong>Pitfall:</strong> Treating larger <strong><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(d||)</marimo-tex></strong> as the only knob for large algorithms (postselection is the alternative story in later phases).</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
